WEBVTT

00:07:29.028 --> 00:07:31.572
and in fact, often, we can do them better,

00:07:31.572 --> 00:07:32.990
and more fashionably.

00:07:33.908 --> 00:07:36.785
JA: Now we often hear that humor
can be so tricky these days,

00:07:36.827 --> 00:07:37.953
and it's true.

00:07:38.412 --> 00:07:39.580
Comedians know this,

00:07:39.622 --> 00:07:41.874
which is why they can practice
hundreds of times

00:07:41.874 --> 00:07:44.668
before a line makes it
into one of their sets.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.254
They also get to wear jeans
and drink whiskey at work.

00:07:47.296 --> 00:07:48.672
It's all very unfair.

00:07:49.131 --> 00:07:52.551
So how can we, as normal,
non-comedian people,

00:07:52.593 --> 00:07:54.553
practice safe sets?

00:07:55.387 --> 00:07:57.932
Start by recognizing it's not about you.

00:07:57.932 --> 00:08:00.976
So don't ask "Will this
make me sound funny?"